      "text": "«domain/game»  Game · Session · Target · Motion\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nGame: -renderer Renderer  -events EventSource  -killer ProcessKiller\n      -processes []procdriven.Info  -targets []*Target  Session (embedded)\n      +New(processes, confirmMode, speed, timeLimit, killer, renderer, events) *Game\n      +Play(highScore int) error\nSession: +RecordKill(rss int64)  +Kills()  +FreedMem()  +StartTime()\nTarget: embeds Info + Motion  ·  State TargetState  ·  +Contains()  +StartKillAnim()\nMotion: PosX PosY VelX VelY float64  ·  +Update(maxX, maxY, labelLen, speed)",
